{"id":"n61951-2-7","stage":4,"title":"뿜다 · 散发","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61951-2-7-1","ko":"자연은 계절마다 참 여러가지 향기를 뿜는 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得大自然每个季节都会散发出各种各样的香气呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자연은","meaning":"自然","explanation":"자연：自然；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자연","audio":"/audio/130c1a6579678dd93209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62392","senseId":"1","lemma":"자연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계절마다","meaning":"季节，季","explanation":"계절：季节，季；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"계절","audio":"/audio/de3d981ff9b0dab8c5c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22537","senseId":"1","lemma":"계절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여러가지","meaning":"多个，许多，多种；种，项，类别，个","explanation":"여러：多个，许多，多种；가지：种，项，类别，个","readings":[{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"},{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17300","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"59921","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"향기를","meaning":"香气，香味","explanation":"향기：香气，香味；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"향기","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72483","senseId":"1","lemma":"향기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뿜는","meaning":"散发，放射","explanation":"뿜다：散发，放射；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"뿜다","audio":"/audio/00dbbe2dc8070b58e6ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61951","senseId":"2","lemma":"뿜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"130c1a6579678dd9","term":"자연","zh":"自然","audio":"/audio/130c1a6579678dd93209.mp3","entryId":"62392","definition":"并非依靠人的力量，而是世界原本就有或自行产生的所有现象或存在。","pronunciation":["자연"]},{"id":"de3d981ff9b0dab8","term":"계절","zh":"季节，季","audio":"/audio/de3d981ff9b0dab8c5c4.mp3","entryId":"22537","definition":"根据自然现象将一年分为春、夏、秋、冬时的其中一部分。","pronunciation":["계ː절","게ː절"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"9132eb626207a0b0","term":"여러","zh":"多个，许多，多种","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3","entryId":"17300","definition":"很多数量的。","pronunciation":["여러"]},{"id":"b16bec1ce2b95619","term":"가지","zh":"种，项，类别，个","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3","entryId":"59921","definition":"表示事物种类的数量单位。","pronunciation":["가지"]},{"id":"913f16597fe350c3","term":"향기","zh":"香气，香味","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3","entryId":"72483","definition":"好闻的味道。","pronunciation":["향기"]},{"id":"00dbbe2dc8070b58","term":"뿜다","zh":"散发，放射","audio":"/audio/00dbbe2dc8070b58e6ae.mp3","entryId":"61951","definition":"强烈地发出光线或气味等。","pronunciation":["뿜ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea8e02eca3c34578efe3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61951-2-7-2","ko":"맞아. 나는 자연이 뿜는 향기는 언제나 좋아.","zh":"对啊。我一直都很喜欢大自然散发出的香气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자연이","meaning":"自然","explanation":"자연：自然；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자연","audio":"/audio/130c1a6579678dd93209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62392","senseId":"1","lemma":"자연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뿜는","meaning":"散发，放射","explanation":"뿜다：散发，放射；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"뿜다","audio":"/audio/00dbbe2dc8070b58e6ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61951","senseId":"2","lemma":"뿜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"향기는","meaning":"香气，香味","explanation":"향기：香气，香味；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"향기","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72483","senseId":"1","lemma":"향기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제나","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"언제나：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"언제나","audio":"/audio/84e71f1184644498ff69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67285","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"130c1a6579678dd9","term":"자연","zh":"自然","audio":"/audio/130c1a6579678dd93209.mp3","entryId":"62392","definition":"并非依靠人的力量，而是世界原本就有或自行产生的所有现象或存在。","pronunciation":["자연"]},{"id":"00dbbe2dc8070b58","term":"뿜다","zh":"散发，放射","audio":"/audio/00dbbe2dc8070b58e6ae.mp3","entryId":"61951","definition":"强烈地发出光线或气味等。","pronunciation":["뿜ː따"]},{"id":"913f16597fe350c3","term":"향기","zh":"香气，香味","audio":"/audio/913f16597fe350c3fb5f.mp3","entryId":"72483","definition":"好闻的味道。","pronunciation":["향기"]},{"id":"84e71f1184644498","term":"언제나","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/84e71f1184644498ff69.mp3","entryId":"67285","definition":"无论何时；或指不管什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["언ː제나"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e0414fe21d0a981529da.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.037,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61951","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对啊。我一直都很喜欢大自然散发出的香气。","这里你画的画是哪一幅呢？","我觉得大自然每个季节都会散发出各种各样的香气呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对啊。我一直都很喜欢大自然散发出的香气。","我觉得大自然每个季节都会散发出各种各样的香气呢。","这里你画的画是哪一幅呢？"],"answer":0}]}
